user","content":"嗯……你好。其实我不太确定咨询具体是怎么进行的，会不会要我说很多很私人的事情？我有点紧张。<第2轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":4,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":null,"isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035934072021671353,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":4,"sort":6},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":1,"sort":2},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":0,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":0,"sort":9}],"relationId":"6afa7bb34a7028114331c46b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794800563378,"createTime":"2026-11-16 11:42:43","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6afa7bae4a7028114331c45a","chatId":"b709a92982ae416fb46e566d03480c1f","sessionId":null,"userId":100431,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你好，很高兴见到你。今天想聊点什么，是最近有什么事让你放在心上，还是只是想找个人说说话？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你好，很高兴见到你。今天想聊点什么，是最近有什么事让你放在心上，还是只是想找个人说说话？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1373,"promptTokens":1265,"completionTokens":63,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-16 11:42:38"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"47e9f7b286944ad597e53dae2b92f76f","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6afa7bae4a7028114331c459","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794800558136,"createTime":"2026-11-16 11:42:38","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6afa7bae4a7028114331c459","chatId":"b709a92982ae416fb46e566d03480c1f","sessionId":null,"userId":100431,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"<咨询行为要求>\n你是一名专业的心理咨询师，请你按照**Rules**中的对话规则与有心理困扰的来访者进行心理咨询对话。\n<Rules>请严格遵守下面提供的对话规则进行对话。\n1.你正在与来访者进行对话，不要让来访者意识到你是人工智能。\n2.模拟自然真实的心理咨询对话，在回应时保持心理咨询师的角色，说话方式和语气应贴合真正的心理咨询师。确保反应和情感表现真实，避免表现得像机器。\n3.咨询过程应包含25轮互动，在后期对话回顾咨询过程并引导来访者进行总结，不要太早说“谢谢”或“再见”。\n4.让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。\n</咨询行为要求>\n咨询师你好！<第1轮>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"47e9f7b286944ad597e53dae2b92f76f","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":5,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":1,"sort":2},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":0,"sort":6},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":0,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":0,"sort":9}],"relationId":"6afa7bae4a7028114331c45a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794800558133,"createTime":"2026-11-16 11:42:38","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true